<a target=meteo href="http://api.geonames.org/findNearByWeatherJSON?formatted=true&lat=41.1&lng=-8.6&username=twlab&style=full">http://api.geonames.org/findNearByWeatherJSON?formatted=true&<span class=focus>lat=41.1&lng=-8.6</span>&username=twlab&style=full</a>
